 is the dsh bundle (**npm name `dsh-ai-memory`**). `Cargo.toml` is the Rust crate"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" (**package name `ai-memory`**). Same repo, two manifests, not two products."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Docs:** USAGE (EN) · 用法 (中文) · ARCHITECTURE (EN) · 架构 (中文) · DeepSeek Harness (EN) · DeepSeek Harn"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"** USAGE (EN) · 用法 (中文) · ARCHITECTURE (EN) · 架构 (中文) · DeepSeek Harness (EN) · DeepSeek Harness（中文）"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Flagship dsh demo:** SME support / ops scenario · 中文 — one long session, budgeted pack, not a JS m"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" demo:** SME support / ops scenario · 中文 — one long session, budgeted pack, not a JS memory rewrite."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**Contribute:** CONTRIBUTING.md · 参与贡献 · Issues · Pull requests"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Scenario → call → get"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"One long session, many related tickets, chat bigger than the model (~1M or smaller): **store each tu"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"rn, then `prefetch_within_budget`**. Pins and high-score hits fill a 2k–32k token pack (`ceil(chars/"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ch_within_budget`**. Pins and high-score hits fill a 2k–32k token pack (`ceil(chars/4)` by default)."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"`open()` applies WAL and other SQLite defaults. Inject a real `Embedder` when you have one; default "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"`HashEmbedder` is offline. Optional `--features sqlite-vec`."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Do / don't"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Do | Don't |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Persist turns with `remember_turn` | Dump the full transcript into the model |\n| `prefetch_within_"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"budget(query, TokenBudget { max_tokens })` | Expect 1M tokens to fit in one prompt |\n| `pin` must-ke"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ep facts | Auto-consolidate or auto-compact |\n| Call `compact_working` / `consolidate` when you mean"},{"id":"p22s4","text":" to | Add an LLM client in this crate |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Isolation is `project_id`. Two sessions on one file do not leak recall."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## DeepSeek Harness (showcase)"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The intended **consumer / showcase** is DeepSeek Harness: a thin Cordis `apply(ctx)` plugin over **t"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"his Rust crate** (SQLite stays here; we do not rewrite memory in JS, and we do not pitch auto-LLM ex"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"rate** (SQLite stays here; we do not rewrite memory in JS, and we do not pitch auto-LLM extraction)."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Install command and verify steps: **Install into DeepSeek Harness** / docs/INSTALL_DSH.md."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- Endorsement / architecture: INTEGRATION_DSH.md · 集成说明（中文）\n- Host implementation: `integrations/dsh"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"-ai-memory/` (re-exported from the repo root)\n- **Flagship usage scenario:** `scenarios/dsh-support-"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"agent/` (sidebar + billing tickets; headless `node …/sim/run.mjs` or real `dsh plugin add`)\n- Host A"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"PI: `HostSession` + `ai-memory` CLI; preferred bridge is in-process **napi-rs** (CLI fallback if the"},{"id":"p27s5","text":" `.node` addon is missing)"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Licensed under either of"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE)\n- MIT license (LICENSE-MIT)"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"at your option."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Develop"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"`package.json` at the repo root is only the dsh bundle. Rust-only work does not need `npm install`. "},{"id":"p34s2","text":"If you do run npm scripts and want to skip compiling the host: `DSH_AI_MEMORY_SKIP_NATIVE=1`."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
